Stem cells to Battle cancer

Stem cell transplant is treatment in some types of cancers like leukemia, multiple myeloma, or some types of lymphoma.

There are several types of immunotherapy, including: Monoclonal antibodies, Non-specific immunotherapies, oncolytic virus therapy, T-cell therapy, Cancer vaccines

